cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ChickenSVA or the CCRP, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
title: "ChickenSVA: An AI-powered genomic knowledge agent for structural variant imputation and interpretation in the chicken genome"
authors:
  - family-names: Gao
    given-names: Chaoqun
  - name: "and co-authors (see manuscript)"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/goodcqzz/ChickenSVA"
abstract: >-
  ChickenSVA combines a comprehensive chicken reference panel (CCRP; 2,063
  genomes, 78 global populations) with an LLM-driven agent for natural-language
  SV query, annotation, trait-association analysis, and Beagle-based SV
  genotype imputation.
keywords:
  - structural variation
  - chicken genomics
  - LLM agent
  - genotype imputation
  - pangenome
license: MIT
